{title: Prada}
{artist: Jass Manak}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
Haan [Am]akhan uttey tere aa [Dm]prada sajna,        [G]Assi time chak de aa [Em]tadda sajna
Ka [Am]ali Range wichon rhne [Dm]velly taad da,        [G]Thonu chehra disda ni [Em]saada sajna
Tere [Am]peeche saakh chade aa [G]yi chaali
Gau [F]ri jatti ghumey Bentley ch [Em]kaali,        Prada [Am]akhaan laake dekh lai
Har [Am]saanh uttey naam [Dm]bole tera,        [Am]Kinna krdi aa jatta-jat [Dm]ti tera
Tu yaari [Am]kera laake dekhley,        [C]Tor teri ambraan da moo [G]on sun lai
[C]Jatti teri honju hun soon [Am]sunn lai,        [C]Tere mere wich kera koyi aa [G]gya
[C]Paaniyan de waangu dullu kho [Am]on sun ley
Vey [Am]me aini-vee-ni paayi jatta [Em]kaahli,        Vey [Am]tu hauli-hauli [Em]ghr de mana li
Tu dil neh [Am]dey aake dekh [G]lai,        Har [Am]saanh utte naam [Dm]bole tera
Kinna [Am]kardi aa [Dm]jatta-jatti tera,        Tu yaari [Am]kera laake dekhle
